      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你别打岔，今天这期内容太炸了，我跟你说我从早上开始就在刷X，整个人处于一种兴奋过度的状态。",
      "start": 12.83,
      "duration": 8.141,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我知道你要说啥，GPT-6对吧。这次更新确实动静不小，但真正让我觉得有意思的不是它又刷了什么榜单，而是陶哲轩那条吐槽。",
      "start": 21.424,
      "duration": 10.884,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对对对！陶哲轩你知道的嘛，数学界公认的顶级大脑，结果他在试GPT-6解孪生素数猜想的时候，AI直接就把关键那一步答案吐出来了，陶哲轩本人回了一句\"令人无语\"。",
      "start": 32.713,
      "duration": 17.347,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，\"令人无语\"这四个字从陶哲轩嘴里说出来，份量跟咱们普通人说完全不一样。你想想，一个研究孪生素数猜想这么多年的人，看到机器直接把中间那个关键桥梁给架好了，他的感受是很复杂的。",
      "start": 50.493,
      "duration": 15.823,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "是那种\"我研究了好几年，你三十秒给我算出来了\"的挫败感吗？",
      "start": 66.781,
      "duration": 5.921,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "不完全是。更深层的其实是震惊于它的推理路径。苏晴你想想，孪生素数猜想的关键从来不是\"答案是什么\"，而是怎么从已知走向未知。GPT-6这次厉害的地方在于，它不是靠暴力搜索或者记忆拼凑，它展示出来的中间步骤，是有结构感的。",
      "start": 73.164,
      "duration": 22.398,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以你说的是，AI现在可能具备了某种意义上的\"数学直觉\"？",
      "start": 96.013,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我不敢说直觉，但它确实展现出一种选择解题方向的能力。这个能力以前我们觉得是人类数学家独有的，就是那种\"我感觉这条路线能走通\"的判断。GPT-6这次让陶哲轩无语，本质上是机器第一次在数学最核心的地盘上，跟人站在了同一条起跑线上。",
      "start": 102.913,
      "duration": 19.568,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这对咱们普通搞研究的人意味着啥？以后是不是数学家都得带个AI当副驾了？",
      "start": 122.919,
      "duration": 7.924,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了就是这样的。但你要换个角度想，AI把中间繁琐的推演接过去了，人类数学家反而能腾出精力去想更上层的问题，这其实是分工的重构，不是谁取代谁。",
      "start": 131.304,
      "duration": 12.495,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，这话题咱先放这儿。说到GPT-6，我看到还有个特别火的概念，叫循环Transformer，周航你给我讲讲呗，这跟传统Transformer有啥区别？",
      "start": 144.244,
      "duration": 12.558,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "传统Transformer你理解成\"一次性把信息从前传到后\"对吧，循环Transformer干的事是让信息在层与层之间反复流转、迭代打磨，有点像咱们写文章时候的反复修改。",
      "start": 157.276,
      "duration": 13.124,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦我懂了，就是原来写一遍交卷，现在改三遍再交卷。",
      "start": 170.827,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个类比挺形象但不完全准确。更准确地说，是模型在每一层处理完信息之后，把结果反馈回去再做一次判断。这种架构创新其实阿里早在顶会上就发过论文了，只不过GPT-6这次把它推到了大众视野里，所以你说\"带火\"这个词用得很准。",
      "start": 176.211,
      "duration": 19.568,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "诶这就有意思了，国内大厂又走在了前面但是没出圈，国外的模型一出圈就变成全球热议。",
      "start": 196.196,
      "duration": 9.622,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这是叙事权的问题。不过循环Transformer这个方向我觉得会持续火下去，因为它确实能解决长文本推理里的一些老毛病。",
      "start": 206.254,
      "duration": 7.793,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好，咱换个话题。周航你知道DeepMind在非洲搞了件事儿吗？我看到的时候真的挺震撼的。",
      "start": 214.464,
      "duration": 6.835,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "塞拉利昂那个RCT对吧。这个我认真读了论文，意义远不止\"AI又做了个教育实验\"那么简单。",
      "start": 221.795,
      "duration": 7.314,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你给我翻译翻译，为啥大家都说它是里程碑？",
      "start": 229.521,
      "duration": 3.439,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "关键在于RCT这三个字。你注意啊，AI教育产品这两年满地都是，什么自适应学习、智能辅导，但绝大多数都没有严格的随机对照试验来证明\"真的是这个产品起的作用，而不是别的因素\"。",
      "start": 233.439,
      "duration": 14.43,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以DeepMind这次是把医学临床那一套搬过来了？",
      "start": 248.301,
      "duration": 4.876,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "就是这个意思。他们在塞拉利昂的教室里做了严格分组，一组用Gemini的Guided Learning功能，一组用传统方式，最后看学习参与度和效率的差异。结果Guided Learning显著胜出。这种证据级别在AI教育领域是极其罕见的。",
      "start": 253.645,
      "duration": 18.349,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，看到这种新闻我是真的又开心又心酸。开心的是AI终于有了硬证据，心酸的是，咱们天天讨论AI能改变世界，结果最需要它的地方是非洲教室里的孩子。",
      "start": 272.484,
      "duration": 16.085,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这恰恰是这件事最值得说道的地方。塞拉利昂教育资源极度匮乏，合格教师数量远远不够，AI辅导不是来锦上添花的，是真的在补最基础的缺口。而且这种RCT的严谨性，也堵住了那些说\"AI教育就是科技公司自嗨\"的嘴。",
      "start": 289.046,
      "duration": 17.565,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那你觉得这套模式能复制到全球吗？",
      "start": 307.029,
      "duration": 2.961,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "短期内挑战很大，但框架是立住了。以后任何AI教育产品想说自己有效，最好都拿得出类似级别的证据，否则市场不会买账。",
      "start": 310.429,
      "duration": 9.448,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到这儿我还有俩快讯想跟你聊。第一个叫ScienceDiscovery九问，说能用树搜索驱动RSI，小时级写出通用积分器，这啥意思？",
      "start": 320.289,
      "duration": 14.237,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个挺反直觉的。你想啊，现在主流AI做科研都是靠大模型加训练数据对吧，但这个项目偏偏反着来——不训练模型，不调参数，纯靠搜索就能让AI发现科学规律。",
      "start": 335.019,
      "duration": 14.648,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那它靠啥？靠穷举？",
      "start": 350.076,
      "duration": 2.307,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "不是蛮力穷举，是结构化的树搜索。研究者把问题拆成九步，每一步给AI一个具体的子任务，让它像走迷宫一样去探索可能的研究路径。九个小时自动跑出一个通用积分器，这个速度对人类研究员来说相当于一周的工作量。",
      "start": 352.87,
      "duration": 19.785,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以这告诉我们一个啥道理？",
      "start": 373.097,
      "duration": 1.959,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了就是，别迷信\"参数越大越牛\"。有时候方法论上的创新，比单纯堆算力更有价值。",
      "start": 375.516,
      "duration": 8.185,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，记住了。还有一个，OKF Agent Memory，在Hacker News上讨论度挺高的，是给AI编程代理做长期记忆的。",
      "start": 384.172,
      "duration": 11.146,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个我专门看了下思路，挺巧妙的。它用Git的版本管理机制来当AI编程代理的记忆存储层，你想想啊，Git天然有版本回溯、有分支管理，正好对应AI代理试错、迭代、回滚的开发流程。",
      "start": 395.73,
      "duration": 16.912,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦我懂了，就是把代码仓库变成AI的\"日记本\"，让它记住自己之前为啥这么写、踩过啥坑。",
      "start": 413.087,
      "duration": 7.924,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对。以前的AI编程代理最头疼的就是\"失忆\"，跑两轮对话就忘了之前的上下文，换个任务就更别提了。OKF这套方案相当于给Coding Agent补上了最关键的长期记忆短板，而且跟Git原生集成这事特别优雅，没有额外的基础设施负担。",
      "start": 421.466,
      "duration": 20.003,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
